  "description": "Expose SignalR hub methods as Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools with the same [McpTool]\n      attribute the core package uses for controllers. A tool call opens a synthetic in-process\n      SignalR connection through the application's own HubConnectionHandler, so hub filters,\n      method-level authorization, OnConnectedAsync and streaming all behave exactly as they do for\n      a real client - and broadcasts reach the clients that are really connected.",
